75
00:02:27.388 --> 00:02:29.444
(pickle squishing)
Uuww.

76
00:02:29.444 --> 00:02:30.800
(audience exclaiming)

77
00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:32.400
Not this.

78
00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:33.233
Ugh!

79
00:02:34.986 --> 00:02:35.850
(Michael coughing)
Well.

80
00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:37.540
Do people make, like, this...

81
00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:38.988
