82
00:02:38.988 --> 00:02:40.079
(Drew coughing)

83
00:02:40.079 --> 00:02:40.920
(audience laughing)

84
00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:41.813
I'm so sorry.

85
00:02:42.891 --> 00:02:43.797
Um, yeah.
Like, who was like,

86
00:02:43.797 --> 00:02:45.890
"Oh, you know what would be good, chocolate and pickles?"

87
00:02:45.890 --> 00:02:48.440
We did not make this, this we bought.

88
00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:50.730
All right, well, I'm going back to the original.

89
00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:54.480
I have to say, I didn't like it at first,

90
00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:56.011
