91
00:02:56.011 --> 00:02:58.030
(audience laughing)

92
00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:59.509
Can I bring a boat?

93
00:02:59.509 --> 00:03:00.540
(audience laughing)

94
00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:03.100
Well, that would be very resourceful, why not?

95
00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:04.726
You get one thing.
Okay, mm-hmm.

96
00:03:04.726 --> 00:03:09.700
Okay, will you please give us one teaser about what we get

97
00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:13.270
