98
00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:15.623
of "The Marvelous Mrs. Maisel?"

99
00:03:15.623 --> 00:03:20.016
(audience clapping and cheering)

100
00:03:20.016 --> 00:03:22.718
I will take your pickles, sir.
Thank you.

101
00:03:22.718 --> 00:03:23.551
I mean...

102
00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:27.710
It's funny. (laughing)

103
00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:29.646
It's like, it's really funny,

104
00:03:29.646 --> 00:03:31.654
I think it's the funniest season so far.

105
00:03:31.654 --> 00:03:32.560
Really?

106
00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:34.980
