111
00:03:44.860 --> 00:03:47.540
Well, I know everyone's gonna be very excited for it.

112
00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:50.070
And Michael, I just, I love you endlessly.

113
00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:52.000
I love you in everything that you do;

114
00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.286
